          "settings": {
            "heading": "<p>\"I GOT TIRED OF SUPERMARKET MOUTHWASHES & FOUND THIS - AN ABSOLOUTE GEM, REALLY EFFECTIVE & WITHOUT CHEMICALS! - WORTH EVERY PENNY\"<\/p>",
